2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901010Z     Features
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901108Z     --------
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901194Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901671Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901873Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1901973Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1902276Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1902392Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1902484Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1902758Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1902942Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903035Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903300Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903419Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903507Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903616Z     - Python 3.10+ or PyPy3
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1903703Z     
2026-09-23T17:04:18.1904191Z     - Rich plugin architecture, with over 1300+ `external plugins <https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/plugin_list.html>`_ and thriving community
